#!/bin/bash

# SOLID Principles Refactored LEMP Tool Scripts
# 
# This refactored version adheres better to SOLID principles:
# - Single Responsibility: Each function has one clear purpose
# - Open/Closed: Configuration-driven behavior, extensible without modification
# - Interface Segregation: Functions have minimal, focused interfaces
# - Dependency Inversion: Abstract interfaces for external dependencies

